message: "If you use this code, figures or tables, please cite the article listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "TRIAD-BRCA+: code, figures and tables for leakage-controlled PAM50 breast cancer subtyping"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Agrawal
    given-names: Himani
    affiliation: "Department of CSE & IT, Jaypee Institute of Information Technology, Noida, India"
    email: agrawal.himani1010@gmail.com
