  type: article
  title: "TRIAD-BRCA+: Knowledge-Guided Heterogeneous Ensembling with Balanced-Risk Decision Calibration for Leakage-Controlled PAM50 Breast Cancer Subtyping and Harmonised Cross-Cohort Transfer"
